# Build output directories #
############################
# These were previously caught only by a machine-level core.excludesFile, so a
# clone on a machine without one would have committed build output. .dcu/.bpl/
# .dcp above cover most of it, but not the .dfm and .res the compiler copies
# into these folders.
37.0/
Packages/*/Delphi/Win32/
Packages/*/Delphi/Win64/
Packages/*/cpp/

